                        "entry_id": "ffe5fe68-907f-3c9a-bb85-103398908931",
                        "glosses": [
                            "À qui n’est octroyé qu’une faible part, (des \\\"miettes\\\")."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
